$NetBSD: patch-Jamtop,v 1.2 2025/03/10 15:38:12 jakllsch Exp $

Search and use pkgsrc ${X11BASE} and ${PREFIX} paths.
Recognize pkgsrc libpng16.so (somewhat haphazardly).
Recognize NetBSD.

--- Jamtop.orig	2024-09-24 22:29:00.000000000 +0000
+++ Jamtop
@@ -86,7 +86,11 @@ if $(UNIX) {
 
